{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"PandorasBox","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"Pandora's Box","Translated":"潘多拉的盒子","Context":"PandorasBox.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ AboutTab.Draw"},{"Original":"Opens the Pandora menu.","Translated":"打开 Pandora 菜单。","Context":"PandorasBox.Initialize","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage"},{"Original":"Enable Theme","Translated":"启用主题","Context":"MainWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Disable Theme","Translated":"禁用主题","Context":"MainWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Selectable"},{"Original":"Name","Translated":"名称","Context":"MainWindow.DrawCommands","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Command","Translated":"命令","Context":"MainWindow.DrawCommands","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Parameters","Translated":"参数","Context":"MainWindow.DrawCommands","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Description","Translated":"描述","Context":"MainWindow.DrawCommands","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Aliases","Translated":"别名","Context":"MainWindow.DrawCommands","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn"},{"Original":"Disabled Reason: ","Translated":"禁用原因：","Context":"MainWindow.DrawFeatures","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Search","Translated":"搜索","Context":"Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Searches feature names and descriptions for a given word or phrase.","Translated":"搜索给定单词或短语的功能名称和描述。","Context":"Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"},{"Original":"Search Results","Translated":"搜索结果","Context":"DrawFeatures","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Zone Whitelist (","Translated":"白名单区域 (","Context":"FeatureConfigEditor.TerritorySelectionEditor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":" territories selected)","Translated":"选定的区域","Context":"FeatureConfigEditor.TerritorySelectionEditor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"},{"Original":"Invalid Auto Field Type: ","Translated":"无效自动字段类型：","Context":"BaseFeature.DrawAutoConfig","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Currently Disabled","Translated":"当前已禁用","Context":"BaseFeature.DrawAutoConfig","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"},{"Original":"Error with AutoConfig: ","Translated":"AutoConfig 错误：","Context":"BaseFeature.DrawAutoConfig","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Uses Peloton automatically outside of combat. (Physical Ranged only)","Translated":"在战斗外自动使用 Peloton。(仅限物理范围)","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Set Delay (seconds)","Translated":"设置延迟 (秒)","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Function only in a duty","Translated":"仅在执行任务时有效","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Use whilst walk status is toggled","Translated":"在步行状态切换时使用","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Exclude Housing Zones","Translated":"排除住宅区","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Abort pending Peloton use during countdown","Translated":"在倒计时期间暂停使用 Peloton","Context":"AutoPeloton.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Auto-Sprint on Island Sanctuary","Translated":"岛屿保护区的自动冲刺","Context":"SanctuarySprint.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically uses Isle Sprint.","Translated":"自动使用 Isle Sprint。","Context":"SanctuarySprint.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Preserve Map Links in Clipboard","Translated":"在剪贴板中保存地图链接","Context":"CoordsToMapLink.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Preserves the formatting for map links so they can be interacted with after pasting.","Translated":"保留地图链接的格式，以便在粘贴后可以与之交互。","Context":"CoordsToMapLink.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Join Party Finder Groups","Translated":"自动加入派对查找器群组","Context":"AutoJoinPF.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Whenever you click a Party Finder listing, this will bypass the description window and auto click the join button.","Translated":"每当你点击 Part Finder 列表时，它都会绕过描述窗口并自动点击加入按钮。","Context":"AutoJoinPF.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-select Gardening Soil/Seeds","Translated":"自动选择园艺土壤/种子","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically fill in gardening windows with seeds and soil.","Translated":"自动用种子和土壤填充花园窗户。","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Moved to YesAlready","Translated":"已移至 YesAlready","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DisabledReason","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Show Only Inventory Items","Translated":"仅显示库存项目","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Soil","Translated":"土壤","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Seed","Translated":"种子","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Include Fertilizing","Translated":"包括施肥","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Fertilizer","Translated":"肥料","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Soil/Seed Fallback","Translated":"土壤/种子退化","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"When enabled, this will select the first soil/seed found in your inventory if the\nprimary ones chosen are not found.","Translated":"当启用时，这将选择您清单中的第一个土壤/种子，如果\n未找到所选的主要选项。","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"},{"Original":"Auto Confirm","Translated":"自动确认","Context":"AutoSelectGardening.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Auto-select Turn-ins","Translated":"自动选择转入","Context":"AutoSelectTurnin.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Whenever you have to select an item to turn in, it will automatically fill in the interface.","Translated":"每当你需要选择一个项目来输入时，它都会自动填充界面。","Context":"AutoSelectTurnin.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Commendation after Duty","Translated":"值班后的自动称赞","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically give a commendation to a random player in your party at the end of a duty.","Translated":"在任务结束时，自动对队伍中的随机玩家进行表扬。","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":" [Auto-Commendation] Please note as this feature was enabled mid-duty, it may not operate correctly if you have queued into the duty with other players in your party before joining.","Translated":"请注意，由于这个功能是在值班期间启用的，如果您在加入之前已经与队伍中的其他玩家一起排队值班，它可能无法正常工作。","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.Enable","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"Prioritize Tank Vote","Translated":"优先考虑坦克投票","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Prioritize Healer Vote","Translated":"优先考虑治疗师投票","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Prioritize DPS Vote","Translated":"优先处理 DPS 投票","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"No Priority","Translated":"无优先级","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Hide Chat Message","Translated":"隐藏聊天消息","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Exclude Party Members That Die","Translated":"排除死亡的党员","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"How Many Times?","Translated":"多少次？","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.DragInt"},{"Original":"Reset Death Tracker on Wipe","Translated":"重置死亡追踪器","Context":"AutoVoteMvp.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Crashing.","Translated":"崩溃。","Context":"DefaultVendorValue.get_DisabledReason","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Default Vendor Buy Amount","Translated":"默认供应商购买金额","Context":"DefaultVendorValue..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Sets the default amount for items to buy from vendors","Translated":"设定从供应商处购买项目的默认金额","Context":"DefaultVendorValue..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds a button to the desynthesis window to desynth all from the current dropdown. (Disclaimer: Pandora takes no responsibility for the loss of any Ultimate weapons or other rare items. Please use responsibly.)","Translated":"在解合成窗口中添加一个按钮，以解合成当前下载的所有内容。(免责声明：潘多拉对任何终极武器或其他稀有物品的损失不承担责任。请负责任地使用。)","Context":"Desynth.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"You are mounted, please dismount","Translated":"您已上车，请下车","Context":"Desynth.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Desynthing. Click to Abort.","Translated":"去合成。点击 “中止”。","Context":"Desynth.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Disable Known Glamours in Glamour Creation","Translated":"在魅力创作中禁用已知魅力","Context":"DisableKnownGlam.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Disables items from being transferred to the glamour dresser if it already exists in it","Translated":"禁止物品转移到魅力梳妆台，如果它们已经存在于其中","Context":"DisableKnownGlam.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically Enabled Yes Buttons","Translated":"自动启用 “是” 按钮","Context":"EnableYesButtons.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Sets the Yes button on Yes/No prompts to automatically be enabled if normally a checkbox needed checked.","Translated":"将 “是” 按钮设置为 “是”/“否” 提示，以在正常情况下需要勾选复选框时自动启用。","Context":"EnableYesButtons.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Saddlebag Entrust Duplicates","Translated":"鞍囊托管复制品","Context":"EntrustChocoboDuplicates.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds a button to the bottom of the saddlebag to entrust duplicates.","Translated":"在鞍囊底部添加一个按钮以委托复制品。","Context":"EntrustChocoboDuplicates.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Entrust Duplicates","Translated":"委托重复项","Context":"EntrustChocoboDuplicates.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Extract All Materia","Translated":"提取所有物质","Context":"ExtractAll.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds a button to the extract materia window to start extracting all.","Translated":"在提取材料窗口中添加一个按钮以开始提取所有内容。","Context":"ExtractAll.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Extract All###StartExtract","Translated":"提取所有","Context":"ExtractAll.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Extracting. Click to abort.###AbortExtract","Translated":"提取。点击中止。","Context":"ExtractAll.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"FC Chest Quick Deposit","Translated":"FC 胸部快速存款","Context":"FCChestQuickDeposit.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Issues with crashing","Translated":"崩溃的问题","Context":"FCChestQuickDeposit.get_DisabledReason","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Adds a context menu to items whilst the FC chest is open to quickly deposit them.","Translated":"在 FC 箱打开时为物品添加上下文菜单，以便快速存放。","Context":"FCChestQuickDeposit.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Default Grand Company Shop Menu","Translated":"默认 Grand Company 商店菜单","Context":"GCVendorDefault.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Sets the default tab in the grand company menu when you open it.","Translated":"打开主菜单时设定默认选项卡。","Context":"GCVendorDefault.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Select Rank","Translated":"选择排名","Context":"GCVendorDefault.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Select Category","Translated":"选择类别","Context":"GCVendorDefault.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Automatically merge stacks of same items","Translated":"自动合并相同项目的堆栈","Context":"MergeStacks.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"When you open your inventory, the plugin will try and pull all stacks of the same item together.","Translated":"当你打开库存时，插件会尝试将所有相同物品的堆栈拉到一起。","Context":"MergeStacks.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Moved to CBT","Translated":"移动到 CBT","Context":"MergeStacks.get_DisabledReason","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Add \"Open All\" to Coffers","Translated":"将 “打开所有” 添加到库存","Context":"OpenAllCoffers.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds an \"Open All\" option to the right click menu of various items that stack and can be opened from the inventory.","Translated":"在堆叠的各种项目的右键菜单中添加 “全部打开” 选项，这些项目可以从清单中打开。","Context":"OpenAllCoffers.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Party Finder Show More","Translated":"派对查找器显示更多内容","Context":"PartyFinderShowMore.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Raise the display limit from 50 to the 100 limit actually allowed by the game.","Translated":"将显示限制从 50 提高到游戏实际允许的 100。","Context":"PartyFinderShowMore.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Quick Lower Quality","Translated":"快速降低质量","Context":"QuickLowerQuality.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically confirms the lower quality popup menu.","Translated":"自动确认低质量弹出式菜单。","Context":"QuickLowerQuality.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Reduce All Items","Translated":"减少所有项目","Context":"ReduceAll.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds a button to Aetherial Reduction to process all items.","Translated":"为以太压缩添加按钮以处理所有项目。","Context":"ReduceAll.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Reduce All###StartReduce","Translated":"减少所有项","Context":"ReduceAll.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Reducing. Click to abort.###AbortReduce","Translated":"还原。点击取消。","Context":"ReduceAll.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Automatically Refresh Party Finder","Translated":"自动刷新当事人查询器","Context":"RefreshPF..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Refreshes the Party Finder at set intervals","Translated":"按固定间隔刷新 Part Finder","Context":"RefreshPF..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"No longer being supported. Someone please PR further updates ty.","Translated":"不再支持。请有人进一步更新我们的公关信息。","Context":"SimplifyRelicQuest.get_DisabledReason","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiEx.Text"},{"Original":"Simplify Relic Quest Pickup","Translated":"简化文物任务拾取","Context":"SimplifyRelicQuest..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Adds a description of what stage a quest is for when talking to the NPC.","Translated":"添加了与 NPC 交谈时任务所处阶段的描述。","Context":"SimplifyRelicQuest..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Sticky Command Panel","Translated":"粘性命令面板","Context":"StickyQuickPanel..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Prevents the Command Panel from closing during load screens.","Translated":"防止命令面板在加载屏幕期间关闭。","Context":"StickyQuickPanel..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Trade All Collectables","Translated":"交易所有收藏品","Context":"TradeAllCollectibles.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Replaces the Trade button on the collectables interface with a Trade All button for the selected collectable.","Translated":"将收藏夹界面上的 “交易” 按钮替换为所选收藏夹的 “全部交易” 按钮。","Context":"TradeAllCollectibles.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Trade All###StartTrade","Translated":"全部交易","Context":"TradeAllCollectibles.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Trading. Click to abort.###AbortTrade","Translated":"交易。点击中止。","Context":"TradeAllCollectibles.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Action Combat Targeting","Translated":"行动战斗目标定位","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically targets and switches your target to the nearest within your line of sight.","Translated":"自动瞄准并将目标切换到视线范围内最近的位置。","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Max Distance (yalms)","Translated":"最大距离 (yallms)","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Don't Unset Target","Translated":"不要取消设定目标","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Unset Target if not in cone range (all times, use with caution)","Translated":"如果目标不在圆锥范围内，则取消设置 (始终谨慎使用)","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Unset Target if not in cone range (only in combat)","Translated":"如果目标不在锥形范围内则不设置 (仅在战斗中)","Context":"ActionTargeting.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Auto-interact with Objects in Instances","Translated":"自动与实例中的对象交互","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically try to pick all the keys, levers, and other thingymabobs. Also works to try and open doors and stuff. (VERY EXPERIMENTAL)","Translated":"自动尝试挑选所有钥匙、操纵杆和其他零件。也可以尝试打开门和其他东西。(非常实验性)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Set delay (seconds)","Translated":"设置延迟 (秒)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Cooldown after interacting (seconds)","Translated":"互动后冷却 (秒)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Max Height Difference (yalms)","Translated":"最大身高差 (yallms)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.SliderFloat"},{"Original":"Exclude Combat","Translated":"排除战斗","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Exclude Exits","Translated":"排除退出","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Only Attempt Whilst Not Moving","Translated":"只尝试而不移动","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Try Interact Method 1 (interacts with most things)","Translated":"尝试互动方法 1(与大多数事物互动)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Try Interact Method 2 (interacts with things method 1 doesn't)","Translated":"尝试互动方法 2(方法 1 不与事物互动)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Try Interact with Both Methods (buggy on many things, use with caution)","Translated":"尝试使用两种方法互动 (在许多方面存在缺陷，使用时要谨慎)","Context":"AutoInteractDungeons.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.RadioButton"},{"Original":"Auto-interact with Gathering Nodes","Translated":"与收集节点的自动互动","Context":"AutoInteractGathering.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Interacts with gathering nodes when close enough and on the correct job.","Translated":"当距离足够近且工作正确时，与聚集节点进行交互。","Context":"AutoInteractGathering.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically Open Chests","Translated":"自动打开胸膛","Context":"AutoOpenChests.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Walk up to a chest to automatically open it. (Does not work with Deep Dungeon chests)","Translated":"走到一个箱子前，自动打开它。(对深渊地下城的箱子无效)","Context":"AutoOpenChests.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"FATE Targeting Mode","Translated":"命中目标模式","Context":"FATETargeting..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"When in a FATE and able to participate (synced), automatically targets FATE associated enemies.","Translated":"当进入 FATE 并能够参与 (同步) 时，会自动瞄准与 FATE 相关的敌人。","Context":"FATETargeting..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Inactivity Dummy Reset","Translated":"非活动虚拟重置","Context":"AfkDummyReset.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically reset enmity on target dummies if you do not perform an action after a specified amount of time.","Translated":"如果在指定时间后未执行操作，将自动重置目标虚拟角色的敌意。","Context":"AfkDummyReset.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto Active Time Maneuver","Translated":"自动活动时间机制","Context":"ATMSolver..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically hits a button or mashes for you when the ATM is on screen.","Translated":"当 ATM 机出现在屏幕上时，会自动为您点击按钮或进行混合操作。","Context":"ATMSolver..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Equip Recommended Gear","Translated":"自动装备推荐装备","Context":"AutoRecommended.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically equip recommended gear upon job changing.","Translated":"工作变更时自动装备推荐装备。","Context":"AutoRecommended.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Switch Gatherers Automatically","Translated":"自动切换收集器","Context":"AutoSwitchGatherer.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Switches to the appropriate gathering job when approaching a gathering spot and you have both Triangulate & Prospect active. Must have a gearset for the job to switch to.","Translated":"当接近集合地点时，切换到合适的集合任务，并且你的 Triangulate 和 Prospect 都处于活跃状态。必须有一个切换到任务的齿轮组。","Context":"AutoSwitchGatherer.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Sync FATEs","Translated":"自动同步事件","Context":"AutoSyncFate.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Syncs when entering a FATE if you're overlevelled.","Translated":"如果过高，在输入 FATE 时会同步。","Context":"AutoSyncFate.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Pandora Quick Gather","Translated":"Pandora 快速收集","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Replaces the Quick Gather checkbox with a new one that enables better quick gathering. Works on all nodes and can be interrupted at any point by disabling the checkbox. Also remembers your settings between sessions.","Translated":"用一个新的快速收集复选框替换快速收集复选框，以实现更好的快速收集。它适用于所有节点，并且可以在任何时候通过禁用复选框来中断。同时还能记住你在会话之间的设置。","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Enable P. Gathering","Translated":"启用 P. 收集","Context":"PandoraGathering.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Remember Item","Translated":"记住项目","Context":"PandoraGathering.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"In the Diadem, this will remember the last slot selected and not the last item due to the varying nature of the nodes.","Translated":"在 Diadem 中，由于节点的性质不同，这将记住最后选择的槽而不是最后的项目。","Context":"PandoraGathering.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Use ","Translated":"使用","Context":"PandoraGathering.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Reveal Hidden Items","Translated":"揭示隐藏的物品","Context":"PandoraGathering.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"This node contains quest nodes which can result in soft-locking the quest. Pandora Gathering has been disabled.","Translated":"该节点包含可能导致任务软锁定的任务节点。Pandora Gathering 已被禁用。","Context":"PandoraGathering.CheckNodeAndClick","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.PrintError"},{"Original":"Hold Shift / ","Translated":"按住 Shift 键/","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":" to Temporarily Disable on Starting a Node","Translated":"在启动节点时暂时禁用","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Disable Starting Buffs on Nodes with Collectibles","Translated":"禁用使用集合物在节点上启动缓冲区","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"This will stop Pandora from using any actions when you start a node with a collectible on it. This is intended to prevent wasting GP on buffs that don't apply to collectibles.","Translated":"这将阻止 Pandora 在启动包含可收藏品的节点时使用任何操作。这旨在防止将 GP 浪费在不适用于可收藏品的 buff 上。","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"},{"Original":"Enable Pandora Gathering","Translated":"启用潘多拉收集","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Remember Item Between Nodes","Translated":"记住节点间的物品","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Don't Buff if Item Not Present","Translated":"如果项目不存在，请勿缓冲","Context":"PandoraGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Min. GP###MinGP1","Translated":"最小 GP","Contex