tdown","Translated":"MSQ 倒计时","Context":"MSQCountdown.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Prints a message in chat with how many main scenario quests left in the current expansion you have to complete.","Translated":"在聊天中打印一条消息，显示当前扩展中还剩多少主要场景任务需要完成。","Context":"MSQCountdown.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"You are currently in ","Translated":"您目前处于","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":" with ","Translated":"使用","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":" quests until completion.","Translated":"任务直到完成。","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":" quests until ","Translated":"任务直到","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"Congratulations! You have no more MSQ quests to complete.... for now!","Translated":"恭喜你！你暂时不用再完成 MSQ 任务了！","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"Congratulations on beating ","Translated":"恭喜击败","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"! Onwards to ","Translated":"！继续向","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"Something is wrong, you apparently have ","Translated":"有什么地方不对劲，你显然......","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.PrintError"},{"Original":" quests left? Surely not. Please contact the developer.","Translated":"任务完成了吗？当然没有。请联系开发者。","Context":"MSQCountdown.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.PrintError"},{"Original":"Glamour Plate Link","Translated":"魅力板链接","Context":"QuickPlateLink.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"For quickly linking multiple gearsets to a glamour plate.","Translated":"快速将多个齿轮组连接到一个迷人的板材上。","Context":"QuickPlateLink.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Reset Enmity","Translated":"重置敌意","Context":"ResetEnmity.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Resets combat with target dummies. Accepts arguments for t(arget) or a(ll). Defaults to all.","Translated":"重置与目标虚拟角色的战斗。接受 t(arget) 或 a(ll) 的参数。默认为所有。","Context":"ResetEnmity.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Test Command","Translated":"测试命令","Context":"TestCommand.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"This is a test command.","Translated":"这是一个测试命令。","Context":"TestCommand.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Test command executed with argument ","Translated":"使用参数执行测试命令","Context":"TestCommand.OnCommand","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ IChatGui.Print"},{"Original":"Use Item","Translated":"使用项目","Context":"UseItem.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Uses an Item from your inventory.","Translated":"使用库存中的物品。","Context":"UseItem.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Open Map Coords","Translated":"自动打开地图编码","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically opens the map to coordinates posted in chat.","Translated":"自动打开地图查看聊天中发布的坐标。","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Include Sonar links","Translated":"包括声纳链接","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Ignore <pos> flags","Translated":"忽略<pos>标志","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Set <flag> without opening the map","Translated":"设置 <flag> 而不打开地图","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Disable while in combat","Translated":"在战斗中禁用","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Channel Filters (Whitelist)","Translated":"通道过滤器 (白名单)","Context":"AutoOpenCoords.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader"},{"Original":"Auto-Teleport to Map Coords","Translated":"自动远程传输到地图协议","Context":"AutoTPCoords.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically teleports to the nearest aetheryte to a map link posted in chat. Requires \"Teleporter\" plugin installed.","Translated":"自动传送到最接近聊天中发布的地图链接的以太网。需要安装 “Teleporter” 插件。","Context":"AutoTPCoords.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically consumes a Gysahl Green in the overworld if you don't have your chocobo out.","Translated":"如果你没有把巧克力棒拿出来，就会在地球上自动消耗 Gyshal Green。","Context":"AutoChocobo.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Collect","Translated":"自动收集","Context":"AutoCollect.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"When switching to FSH, ensures Collector's Glove will always be on.","Translated":"切换到 FSH 时，确保收集者的手套始终处于开启状态。","Context":"AutoCollect.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Cordial","Translated":"自动友好","Context":"AutoCordial.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically use a cordial when below a given threshold.","Translated":"当低于给定阈值时，自动使用甜味剂。","Context":"AutoCordial.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Summon Fairy/Carbuncle","Translated":"自动召唤精灵/Carbuncle","Context":"AutoFairy.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically summons your Fairy or Carbuncle upon switching to SCH or SMN respectively.","Translated":"当分别切换到 SCH 或 SMN 时，会自动召唤你的 Fairy 或 Carbuncle。","Context":"AutoFairy.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Meditation","Translated":"自动冥想","Context":"AutoMeditation.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically use Meditation when out of combat.","Translated":"退出战斗后自动使用冥想。","Context":"AutoMeditation.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Motif (Out of Combat)","Translated":"自动模式 (非战斗状态)","Context":"AutoMotif.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically draws motifs when outside of combat and not in a sanctuary.","Translated":"当在战斗之外而非避难所中时，会自动绘制图案。","Context":"AutoMotif.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Mount After Combat","Translated":"战斗后的自动安装","Context":"AutoMountCombat.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Mounts upon ending combat.","Translated":"战斗结束后上马。","Context":"AutoMountCombat.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Select Mount","Translated":"选择坐骑","Context":"AutoMountCombat.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.BeginCombo"},{"Original":"Disable in fates","Translated":"命运中的残疾","Context":"AutoMountCombat.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Jump after mounting","Translated":"登山后跳下","Context":"AutoMountCombat.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Auto-Mount after Gathering","Translated":"收集后的自动安装","Context":"AutoMountGathering.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Mounts upon finishing gathering from a node. Will try to execute for up to 3 seconds after the delay if moving.","Translated":"从节点完成收集后安装。如果移动，将在延迟后尝试执行最多 3 秒。","Context":"AutoMountGathering.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Use on Island Sanctuary","Translated":"在岛屿庇护所中使用","Context":"AutoMountGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Start moving after mounting","Translated":"安装后开始移动","Context":"AutoMountGathering.get_DrawConfigTree","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Auto-Mount on Zone Change","Translated":"区域变更时的自动安装","Context":"AutoMountZoneChange.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Mounts on zone change if not already mounted.","Translated":"区域内的安装位置如果尚未安装，则会发生变化。","Context":"AutoMountZoneChange.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Prospect/Triangulate","Translated":"自动前景/三角测量","Context":"AutoProspectTriangulate.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"When switching to MIN or BTN, automatically activate the other jobs searching ability.","Translated":"当切换到 MIN 或 BTN 时，会自动激活其他职位搜索功能。","Context":"AutoProspectTriangulate.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Sprint in Sanctuaries","Translated":"庇护所中的自动冲刺","Context":"AutoSprint.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Automatically uses sprint when in an area you are gaining rested experience, such as cities.","Translated":"当你在某个地区 (如城市) 获得休息经验时，会自动使用冲刺计划。","Context":"AutoSprint.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Auto-Tank Stance","Translated":"自动坦克姿势","Context":"AutoTankStance.get_Name","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Activates your tank stance automatically upon job switching or entering a dungeon.","Translated":"当您切换工作或进入地下城时，自动激活坦克站姿。","Context":"AutoTankStance.get_Description","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Map Hotbar Decipher","Translated":"地图热条解密","Context":"HotbarMapDecipher..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"},{"Original":"Allows deciphering treaure maps from hotbar.","Translated":"允许从 Hotbar 解密悲伤地图。","Context":"HotbarMapDecipher..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.TextWrapped"}],"resources":[],"attributes":[]}